</entryLink><entryLink id="75e6-3fcf-0f6c-1e49" name="Frag Grenades" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="cf9c-327b-3449-00d7"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="3cef-04a4-03c2-5801"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="23a4-9f7a-e7c7-ad1f"/></constraints></entryLink><entryLink id="e1be-16f1-9252-8609" name="Krak Grenades" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="99df-2421-acf7-a5ad"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="7a8d-0b53-b625-ec33"/><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="dc07-6185-8b28-5163"/></constraints></entryLink></entryLinks><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="e37f-5f32-4094-d80e" name="infantry" hidden="false" targetId="8b4f-bfe2-ce7b-f1b1" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="94c0-e337-ae2c-8ee9" name="character" hidden="false" targetId="f75a-d5c1-59ba-5c5a" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="8edf-9a53-0669-c7a5" name="indep" hidden="false" targetId="4f07-3d45-4f28-a0c6" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="37c4-ac69-c8be-7591" name="unique" hidden="false" targetId="aa94-5c65-d1f1-46a4" primary="false"/></categoryLinks></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><rules><rule id="fa53-2b74-ee3d-420e" name="Hexagrammaton (Luther)" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="99" hidden="false"><description>Luther does not pick one Hexagrammaton Unit Sub-type at the start of the battle; instead, at the start of each of the Controlling Player's turns one of the Hexagrammaton Unit Sub-types may be selected for him until the start of the next turn.</description></rule><rule id="d2ef-1efb-31d5-d287" name="Secrets and Lies" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="99" hidden="false"><description>Luther may not be selected as part of an army that also includes Lion El'Jonson.</description></rule><rule id="d3b5-0498-d37b-2d28" name="Damnation’s Destiny" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="99" hidden="false"><description>An opponent may never claim Victory Points from the Slay the Warlord secondary objective for Luther. Luther is never counted toward Attrition totals.</description></rule><rule id="ad97-5d81-8e9d-86e5" name="Warlord: The Fallen" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="99" hidden="false"><description>If chosen as Warlord, Luther has The Fallen and may not select another. Luther and units with Legiones Astartes (Dark Angels) in his Detachment gain Hatred (Dark Angels). The army may make an additional Reaction during the opponent's Assault phase as long as Luther has not been removed as a casualty.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="695d-4ecf-191a-9d79" name="Legiones Astartes (Dark Angels)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="513e-0647-996a-6229"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Legiones Astartes (Dark Angels*)"/></modifiers></infoLink><infoLink id="bbc7-0ddc-b7cb-0376" name="Master of the Legion" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="c772-87ea-d49c-c7ba"/><infoLink id="5fcf-5d6b-0233-6c3e" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-522d"/><infoLink id="b3d7-a903-2a4e-d336" name="Traitor" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="eff2-8b0e-21da-2f0d"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry><selectionEntry name="[LC] Merir Astelan" type="unit" id="6fef-c190-b959-ca94" page="100" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="84ed-825f-98ec-c18e" name="hq" hidden="false" targetId="4f85-eb33-30c9-8f51" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="277c-1ba0-9cbe-0d1a" name="unit" hidden="false" targetId="36c3-e85e-97cc-c503" primary="false"/></categoryLinks><costs><cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="175"/></costs><selectionEntries><selectionEntry type="model" name="Astelan" id="c239-c7b2-2050-7711" page="100" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599"><profiles><profile id="9060-095c-6e2d-f3ab" name="Astelan" typeId="4bb