s><rule id="5b05-3b50-b328-4836" name="Fortress of the Mind" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="100" hidden="false"><description>Any Psychic Power, friendly or enemy, that targets Astelan or a unit he has joined suffers a -2 penalty to the Psychic Check.</description></rule><rule id="9304-6c27-b434-556c" name="Warlord: Inspirational Leader" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="100" hidden="false"><description>If chosen as Warlord, Astelan has Inspirational Leader and may not select another. Friendly Legiones Astartes (Dark Angels) units with line of sight to Astelan add +1 to Leadership. The army may make an additional Reaction during the opponent's turn in any phase as long as Astelan has not been removed as a casualty.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="3774-a5cb-d6f4-ec14" name="Legiones Astartes (Dark Angels)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="513e-0647-996a-6229"/><infoLink id="3c35-36bc-1e10-546c" name="Master of the Legion" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="c772-87ea-d49c-c7ba"/><infoLink id="ca68-74f9-caa1-26b3" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-522d"/><infoLink id="11d6-f2f2-3587-7b2d" name="Adamantium Will (X+)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4380-44a5-f01a-d964"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Adamantium Will (3+)"/></modifiers></infoLink><infoLink id="ab1d-03a8-63c2-1604" name="Stormwing" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="8f98-3f81-35dc-8a23"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry><selectionEntry name="[LC] Inner Circle Indomitus Squad" type="unit" id="2083-17a5-9feb-611b" page="101" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="15fe-be9f-2120-3146" name="elites" hidden="false" targetId="7aee-565f-b0ae-294e" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="4161-db8f-f247-fd5f" name="unit" hidden="false" targetId="36c3-e85e-97cc-c503" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="518b-762c-3389-66ec" name="terminators" hidden="false" targetId="bab3-f50d-3e5f-2f78" pri