ge="105" hidden="false"><description>A Detachment containing Fabius Bile may ignore the 0-1 restriction on Terata Enhanced Warriors.</description></rule><rule id="50f3-026c-5f06-19c2" name="The Chirurgeon" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="105" hidden="false"><description>Provides Fabius Bile with the Feel No Pain (4+) and It Will Not Die (4+) special rules. Whenever he attacks in the Assault Phase he may make 3 additional attacks with the profile: Str +1, AP 3, Melee, Unwieldy, Shred, Breaching (5+).</description></rule><rule id="dd92-ab6d-6a95-d91c" name="Warlord: The Perfect Creations" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="105" hidden="false"><description>If chosen as the army's Warlord, Fabius Bile automatically has The Perfect Creations as his Warlord Trait and may not select any other. All Terata Enhanced Warrior units in the army may select one additional Genetic Enhancement. Additionally, the army may make an additional Reaction during the opponent's Movement phase as long as Fabius Bile has not been removed as a casualty.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="8659-88ca-7f0a-00c4" name="Legiones Astartes (Emperor's Children)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4a36-8b9d-6b6c-51e1"/><infoLink id="0363-9347-4b12-f74c" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-522d"/><infoLink id="76ce-c91f-c279-50fe" name="Traitor" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="eff2-8b0e-21da-2f0d"/><infoLink id="83cb-af4b-8fcd-fec7" name="Feel No Pain (X)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="ec46-ff29-32e0-c2aa"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Feel No Pain (4+)"/></modifiers></infoLink><infoLink id="8830-567b-2d7b-99d8" name="It Will Not Die (X)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="2784-d0be-a4e2-890f"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="It Will Not Die (4+)"/></modifiers></infoLink></infoLinks></selectionEntry><selectionEntry name="[LC] Solomon Demeter" type="unit" id="b952-4016-6747-2cf1" p