/selectionEntry></selectionEntries><rules><rule id="d35a-648d-4f26-c2be" name="Master-Crafted Force Staff" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="125" hidden="false"><description>Targutai Yesugei's Force Staff has the Master-Crafted Special Rule.</description></rule><rule id="4569-f054-6f75-094e" name="Master of the Zadyin Arga" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="125" hidden="false"><description>Always knows the Telepathy and The Storm's Fury Psychic Disciplines, and may not select any others. May take a Dark Sons of Death unit as a Retinue as if he were a Legion Consul with the Stormseer upgrade.</description></rule><rule id="0801-74f9-f580-478c" name="Warlord: Stormseer's Fury" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="125" hidden="false"><description>If chosen as Warlord he has Stormseer's Fury and may not select another. He and any unit he has joined gain Hatred (Traitors). The army gains an additional reaction in the Opposing Player's Shooting phase while he has not been removed as a casualty.</description></rule><rule id="919c-8ae5-cf93-56a2" name="Movement" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="125" hidden="false"><description>*The additional Movement bonus granted by the Legiones Astartes (White Scars) Special Rule is included.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="d219-8906-4f88-4543" name="Legiones Astartes (White Scars)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4b54-8bd0-9fdd-cbc4"/><infoLink id="dae4-f153-fa33-b731" name="Master of the Legion" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="c772-87ea-d49c-c7ba"/><infoLink id="28b1-8fdf-14ab-6f04" name="Loyalist" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="d1de-a45d-2b9b-c878"/><infoLink id="8ecb-540a-2b22-509a" name="Adamantium Will (X+)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4380-44a5-f01a-d964"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Adamantium Will (3+)"/></modifiers></infoLink><infoLink id="8116-1fdf-0a72-02a1" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-52