en="false"><description>A Legion Command Squad equipped with Legion Scimitar Jetbikes which has Shiban Khan as its leader may exchange them for Legion Shamshir Jetbikes at no additional points cost.</description></rule><rule id="83f7-3637-e63f-763e" name="Warlord: Lord of the Storm" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="126" hidden="false"><description>If chosen as Warlord he has Lord of the Storm and may not select another. In his Detachment any Cavalry unit may re-roll failed Shrouded Damage Mitigation rolls. He and any unit he joins automatically pass Dangerous Terrain tests. The army gains an additional reaction in the Opposing Player's Assault phase while he has not been removed as a casualty.</description></rule><rule id="c208-233d-c837-41fa" name="Movement" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="126" hidden="false"><description>*The additional Movement bonus granted by the Legiones Astartes (White Scars) Special Rule is included.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="343e-7d15-8c53-2e49" name="Legiones Astartes (White Scars)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4b54-8bd0-9fdd-cbc4"/><infoLink id="a345-cdf1-0241-f21e" name="Master of the Legion" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="c772-87ea-d49c-c7ba"/><infoLink id="86a9-e401-6760-78fe" name="Loyalist" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="d1de-a45d-2b9b-c878"/><infoLink id="c48a-d3ba-627c-717f" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-522d"/><infoLink id="20ac-72bc-f25b-4c5b" name="Inexorable" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="d863-8a5e-ddb6-d5a4"/><infoLink id="6c9a-7cfb-542f-c460" name="Furious Charge (X)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="2821-9269-862f-0554"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Furious Charge (1)"/></modifiers></infoLink></infoLinks></selectionEntry><selectionEntry name="[LC] Ebon Keshig Cataphractii Cohort" type="unit" id="a41a-58aa-6f53-1662" page="127" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599"><categoryLinks><categoryLi