"94ec-3e28-2764-eecc" name="May take a" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="2c92-d65d-d170-b175"/></constraints><entryLinks><entryLink id="e3a5-ecc1-5ae0-3fe6" name="Chainsword" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="06e7-a6ae-ed1c-eb03"><costs><cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="2"/></costs></entryLink></entryLinks></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="c758-438f-e935-4f88" name="infantry" hidden="false" targetId="8b4f-bfe2-ce7b-f1b1" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="2ff0-0252-8d35-72c2" name="character" hidden="false" targetId="f75a-d5c1-59ba-5c5a" primary="false"/></categoryLinks></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><rules><rule id="7e0d-2a6e-0800-1295" name="Ghola Sub-type" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="157" hidden="false"><description>-1 penalty to Movement and Initiative (already applied in the profile). Gains the Heavy Unit Sub-type, Feel No Pain (5+) and Stubborn. Successful Wounds from attacks with Poisoned or Fleshbane must be re-rolled against models with the Ghola Sub-type.</description></rule><rule id="305e-fc70-16f0-936c" name="Heavy options" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="157" hidden="false"><description>For every five models in the unit, one Iron Revenant may exchange their Bolter for a Graviton Gun (+10), Plasma Gun (+10), Volkite Culverin (+15) or Meltagun (+15).</description></rule><rule id="fbe8-b46d-ffc6-5819" name="Dedicated Transport" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="157" hidden="false"><description>A squad of any size may take a Legion Rhino Transport as a Dedicated Transport; no extra Force Organisation slot, points still paid.</description></rule><rule id="dcf0-41fc-5e20-7344" name="Characteristics" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="157" hidden="false"><description>*Ghola characteristic penalties already applied.</description></r