er Blades)" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="88f0-9252-1560-8cd7"><constraints><constraint type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="00ca-0823-e8b7-0cf3"/><constraint type="max" value="12" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" id="a526-ffdf-b6cc-8bb8"/></constraints><entryLinks><entryLink id="88f0-9252-1560-8cd7" name="Mansplitter Blades" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="e0c8-32cc-7dab-7705"/><entryLink id="befb-9373-0888-0b7f" name="Power Fist" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="768d-b89b-7328-d749"><costs><cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="5"/></costs></entryLink><entryLink id="cfb6-aa91-1870-962f" name="Chainfist" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="7347-c5b1-5da3-a78f"><costs><cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="10"/></costs></entryLink><entryLink id="ef69-b2a3-be0b-f09c" name="Pair of Lightning Claws" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="a6d2-b3a9-6d2c-1f6f"><costs><cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="10"/></costs></entryLink><entryLink id="765d-3e43-8990-8cc6" name="Cadere Weapon" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="a056-5141-9c19-b206"><costs><cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="15"/></costs></entryLink><entryLink id="3bca-d7b1-de81-eea9" name="Two Falax Blades" hidden="false" type="selectionEntry" targetId="97ad-7991-5b27-c031"><costs><cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="15"/></costs></entryLink></entryLinks></selectionEntryGroup></selectionEntryGroups><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="fe11-5a3e-02ce-9d9a" name="infantry" hidden="false" targetId="8b4f-bfe2-ce7b-f1b1" primary="false"/><categoryLink id="7513-4cbf-a282-7be7" name="heavy" hidden="false" targetId="9231-183c-b97b-63f9" primary="false"/></categoryLinks></selectionEntry></selectionEntries><rules><rule id="58ab-d41a-ddcb-60ed" name="Two Mansplitter Blades" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="163" hidden="false"><description>The unit is armed with two Mansplitter Blades per model (modelled as one entry).</description></rule><rule id="b231-7f66-bdc3-9148" name="Devourer Retinue" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="163" hidden="false"><description>May be included as a Retinue Squad instead of an Elites choice, in a Detachment with at least one model with Master of the Legion and Legiones Astartes (World Eaters). That model must be the squad's leader and may not voluntarily leave. Uses no Force Organisation slot; part of the same unit as its leader. If selected this way they lose Bitter Duty. 0-1.</description></rule><rule id="ebfd-7e39-5e1b-6085" name="Mansplitter Blades" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="163" hidden="false"><description>Weighted Edge: any attacks made with a weapon with this Special Rule are made at Initiative 2.</description></rule><rule id="cee0-71a0-6691-e38f" name="Dedicated Transport" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="163" hidden="false"><description>Five models or less: Legion Land Raider Proteus Carrier. Ten models or less: Legion Land Raider Spartan. No extra Force Organisation slot; points still paid.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="80f1-2035-53f5-ff9a" name="Legiones Astartes (World Eaters)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="405d-019f-9ef6-423c"/><infoLink id="cda0-cb86-4f3b-d5d1" name="Bulky (X)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="676c-7b75-4b6f-9405"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Bulky (2)"/></modifiers></infoLink><infoLink id="48fa-5848-b33a-5cab" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-522d"/><infoLink id="d1ec-b283-e3c5-d865" name="Chosen Warriors" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="13d1-9270-6539-08ed"/><infoLink id="69e2-8df9-fc42-6dfb" name="Fearless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="b48c-d7e1-2a83-2f5b"/><infoLink id="5711-c92f-b81d-07e7" name="Feel No Pain (X)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="ec4