that includes any models with this Special Rule may only be joined by, or join, models/units which also have this Special Rule. If joined by Aeonid Thiel, the unit gains Preferred Enemy (Legiones Astartes). (Independent Characters may purchase it for +10 under the Rite of War: The Red Marked.)</description></rule><rule id="dad5-0356-8300-e373" name="Distrusted By Our Own" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="168" hidden="false"><description>A unit with this Special Rule can never benefit from any positive modifiers to its Leadership from any friendly units, unless it is from a unit with Brothers in Censure, or from the effects of The Red Marked Rite of War. It may still use Aeonid Thiel's Leadership Characteristic if he joins the unit.</description></rule><rule id="c6de-215c-188c-9cb9" name="Dedicated Transport" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="168" hidden="false"><description>No more than 10 models: Legion Rhino Transport or Legion Land Raider Proteus Carrier; any size: Legion Storm Eagle Gunship. No extra Force Organisation slot; points still paid.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="b329-7fad-004c-5c7d" name="Legiones Astartes (Ultramarines)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="519d-a6ed-f57f-3642"/><infoLink id="647a-17dd-b749-2b55" name="Stubborn" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7989-1f2c-a43d-82ae"/><infoLink id="6c23-80a6-3f3c-36e1" name="Chosen Warriors" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="13d1-9270-6539-08ed"/><infoLink id="b10e-1ba8-d480-5e2d" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-522d"/></infoLinks></selectionEntry><selectionEntry name="[LC] Deathshroud Cataphractii Terminator Squad" type="unit" id="33e7-cd5b-8a7e-2dbf" page="173" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="5486-a91b-ef9e-0402" name="elites" hidden="false" targetId="7aee-565f-b0ae-294e" primary="true"/><categoryLink id="3670-3354-b044-9ce6" name="unit" hidden="false" targetId="36c3-e85e-97cc-c50