ies><rules><rule id="906e-9228-0395-24fa" name="Line Breakers" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="193" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, when determining combat resolution scores for a combat that includes a unit with this Special Rule, you may add the total of all remaining Wounds the unit has to its score for determining how many Wounds were inflicted.</description></rule><rule id="afd7-92ff-5f76-beae" name="Retinue" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="193" hidden="false"><description>Special rule as printed in the Liber Centura (wording not on the unit page).</description></rule><rule id="0e4f-2d04-a940-b556" name="Combi-Bolter + Power Weapon" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="193" hidden="false"><description>Any model may exchange both Combi-Bolter and Power Weapon for Two Tainted Talons (+20).</description></rule><rule id="ecaa-08e7-416e-c5b0" name="Dedicated Transport" publicationId="3970-79bb-bdc6-9599" page="193" hidden="false"><description>No more than five models: Legion Land Raider Proteus Carrier or Legion Dreadclaw Drop Pod; more than five: Legion Land Raider Spartan. No extra Force Organisation slot; points still paid.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="1d25-3e92-c32f-71c1" name="Legiones Astartes (Word Bearers)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="21ba-24fc-3fad-00fe"/><infoLink id="6bed-7cea-c23a-5bdd" name="Adamantium Will (X+)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="4380-44a5-f01a-d964"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Adamantium Will (4+)"/></modifiers></infoLink><infoLink id="7874-9c4b-ce80-a54c" name="Feel No Pain (X)" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="ec46-ff29-32e0-c2aa"><modifiers><modifier type="set" field="name" value="Feel No Pain (5+)"/></modifiers></infoLink><infoLink id="663d-2f3d-22f0-1638" name="Relentless" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7adf-ac9a-5035-522d"/><infoLink id="4269-49cc-eb93-8a06" name="Stubborn" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="7989-1f2c-a43d-